  - rho < 1 for ALL realistic tool classes (median 0.007–0.508; 0–9% clearing rho>=1; search_rag collapses to 0% under realistic N_step). The lucrative regime (rho>=2) does not exist in real agent tool traffic. Nothing meaningful to overlap.
  - Dumb-truncation @N=512 captures 100% actionable content for 4/5 real classes. The detector/redo apparatus is unjustified everywhere rho is low.
  - Adversarial (f_fl, rho) bind CONFIRMED: the only high-rho class (search_rag) is also the only non-end-front-loaded (5.5% actionable-end <=0.3) AND the only truncation-resistant (0–14.5%). Early-commit would commit WRONG exactly where it has time to commit.
  - Production incremental-prefill (vLLM/SGLang/TGI) already overlaps the addressable latency losslessly for 46–225-tok results (sub-100ms on H100). The wait-for-EOF stall the claim monetizes is a strawman baseline.
